{
  "$comment": "Records and the source type each must be given. Read by packages/domain/test/sourceTypeCases.test.mjs (evidenceSourceTypeOf) and runtime/mcp/evimed-research/test/test_source_types.py (source_type_of): the two readers of source-types.json must agree on every case.",
